OL,3,GNEWSA'Total nightmare' as stuck caravan
OL,4,Ablocks road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA static caravan has been left stuck
OL,7,Fand blocking a road in north Wales.
OL,9,FThe caravan was seen scraping bushes
OL,10,Fand trees as it was carried by lorry up
OL,11,Fthe narrow, single-track Llewelyn Road
OL,12,Fin Tanyfron, Wrexham, on Friday.
OL,14,FNorth Wales Police said on Monday they
OL,15,Fwere in the process of arranging for
OL,16,Fthe caravan to be moved and will
OL,17,F"consider any potential offences in due
OL,18,Fcourse".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
