OL,3,GNEWSA'Total nightmare' as stuck caravan
OL,4,Ablocks road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wrexham councillor said the closure
OL,7,Fwas putting pressure on other roads in
OL,8,Fthe area, while a resident described it
OL,9,Fas a "total nightmare".
